    "directions": [
      "Preheat oven to 250 degrees F.",
      "In a saucepan over medium-high heat, melt the butter with the brown sugar and beer.",
      "Boil until slightly thickened, about 6 minutes.",
      "Turn off the heat and add the garlic powder, salt, curry powder, cayenne, and chili powder; stir to combine.",
      "Add the nuts; toss to coat.",
      "Add the nuts to a baking sheet lined with a silicone mat or parchment paper.",
      "Bake for 15 minutes.",
      "Stir the nuts, then bake for an additional 15 minutes.",
      "Allow to cool completely, break apart, then transfer to an airtight container to store."
    ],
